cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "2D Wave Equation -- Spectral Element Method"
abstract: >-
  Matrix-free spectral element solver for the two-dimensional scalar wave
  equation with explicit time integration, implemented in C++/OpenMP (FP64)
  and CUDA (FP32), with a Python layer for runs, benchmarks and plots.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Quintana Diaz"
    given-names: "Eduardo"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - spectral element method
  - wave equation
  - matrix-free
  - sum factorization
  - CUDA
  - OpenMP
